// BT-4317: a class whose `tag` is shadowed by a class-side extension
// (own_class_literal_send_test.bt), so `Bt4317OwnLiteralShadowed tag` takes
// the dynamic fallback rather than the guarded direct call.

Value subclass: Bt4317OwnLiteralShadowed

  class tag -> Symbol => #compiled

  class who -> Symbol => Bt4317OwnLiteralShadowed tag
